.TH sam-jail-remove 1 2026-11-10 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-remove \- Remove an app, its extraction, launcher and (unless \-\-keep\-data) its private home. Refuses while the app runs, unless \-\-stop
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail remove\fR [\fB\-\-keep\-data\fR] [\fB\-\-stop\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIAPP\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove an app, its extraction, launcher and (unless \-\-keep\-data) its private home. Refuses while the app runs, unless \-\-stop
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-keep\-data\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-stop\fR
Close the app first if it is running (instead of refusing)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIAPP\fR>

